<title>MOROCCO: Morocco seeks to lure investors.</title>
<headline>Morocco seeks to lure investors.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moroccan banks and the finance ministry signed a convention to set up data bank on investment projects, a finance ministry official said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The data will give administrative guidance to potential investors in order to attract more of them, he said.</p>
</text>
